{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1910","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Sum of Digits of Sums"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"6 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an array $$$[a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n]$$$, consisting of positive integers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For every $$$i$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$, calculate $$$\\sum \\limits_{j=1}^{n} F(a_i + a_j)$$$, where $$$F(x)$$$ is the sum of digits of $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\lt 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$n$$$ integers. The $$$i$$$-th of them should be equal to $$$\\sum \\limits_{j=1}^{n} F(a_i + a_j)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"ro